cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it, and preferably the paper, as below."
type: software
title: "ISPOG - Is it Playable on Guitar?"
abstract: >-
  Checks the playability of MusicXML scores on the guitar: every note is assigned
  string and fret positions, simultaneous and held notes are fingered together, and
  the score is returned with noteheads colored as playable, difficult or unplayable.
authors:
  - family-names: Mancuso
    given-names: Stefano
version: 0.10.0b3
date-released: 2026-10-07
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
url: "https://ispog.onrender.com"
repository-code: "https://github.com/StefanoMancuso/ISPOG"
keywords:
  - guitar
  - playability
  - MusicXML
  - computer-assisted composition
  - music informatics
